              },
              {
                "textRuns": [
                  {
                    "value": "UCI Machine Learning Repository, Wine Quality (Cortez et al., 2009), licence CC BY 4.0. https://archive.ics.uci.edu/dataset/186. The red and white files were combined with a Type column; values are as published.",
